    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωνεύω</span></b> , 
			contr.
		 fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοανεύω</span> (q. v.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>coat</i> jars <i>with pitch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς χωνεύοντας κεραμεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.441.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεχωνευκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					741.26
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: but pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεχωνημένα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				742.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωνεύω</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωνάω</span> became assimilated; cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχώνευτος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχώνητος</span>
			(<span class="entity">Addenda</span>)).</div>
